{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"incontent\" id=\"blockcontent\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n<div class=\"colleft mt-1\" id=\"date\">\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">發布日期   2026年11月13日 16:14 星期五</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upper\"><p>上午10時許，石硤尾窩仔街近偉智街港鐵石硤尾站A出口對開，一輛專線小巴撞倒一名老翁，76歲黃姓事主右腳受傷，清醒由救護車送往明愛醫院。</p></div>\n<div id=\"lower\">\n<div class=\"articlelogin\"><p>警方到場調查，相信涉事小巴駛離小巴站時，撞倒正在小巴旁推著單車的事主，76歲姓林小巴司機涉嫌危險駕駛引致他人身體受嚴重傷害被捕，現正被扣留調查。</p></div><p>相關字詞﹕危險駕駛 </p> </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T08:58:44.834605+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T08:14:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T10:36:55.999393+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T08:52:08.622361+00:00","content_hash":"eebfc084db9045b0bf0ed6fe79256caf37f88247a97b30758b02988a381b0af4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T08:58:44.834605+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}